{% doc %}
  The default "Support" emblem (design review H): a speech bubble with a
  check mark on a rounded square, coloured from the host's brand through
  --pos-support-monogram-background / -text. Used when the host gives no
  logo (sidebar) and, drawn to a PNG by an admin's browser, as the default
  app icon (manifest, home screen, favicon, push). Decorative.
{% enddoc %}
